extends layout
include mixins

block content
  +heading('New sign-in to your account')
  +greeting(firstName)
  p(style="margin:0 0 20px 0; font-size:15px; line-height:1.6; color:#000909;")
    | We noticed a new sign-in to your Fiam account.
  +detailsCard()
    +row('Device', deviceName)
    +row('Time', occurredAt)
    +row('IP address', ipAddress)
  p(style="margin:0; font-size:14px; line-height:1.6; color:#7F7F7F;")
    | If this was you, no action is needed. If you don't recognise this activity, please change your password immediately.
